  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "財務規劃與投資決策",
    "sub_ename": "FINANCIAL PLANNING AND INVESTMENT DECISION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程講授財務規劃與投資決策的基本觀念。內容涵蓋企業財務規劃的理論與實務，進而協助管理當局進行投資決策的參考，介紹投資工具的類別與市場型態，風險與報酬的衡量方法，投資決策的評價與分析。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is teaching basic concept of financial planning and investment decision. The content is including theory and practice of company financial planning. And provide the reference of manage to make investment decision. This course also introduces items and types of investment market, measurement mothed of risk and returns, evaluation and analysis of investment decisions.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
